// Style-only markdown lint rules, turned off for this workshop workspace.
//
// MD013 (line-length): the 80-character limit is a style preference. Prose
//   lines that run longer still read and render exactly the same.
// MD024 (duplicate headings): the starter notebooks deliberately reuse the
//   same section names ("Part 1 — Predict (no code)" and so on) inside
//   different exercises.
// MD025 (single-title): Quarto documents get one H1 from their YAML title;
//   markdownlint compares that against headings inside the body, which isn't
//   how Quarto structure works.
//
// Nothing here affects code, analysis results, or `quarto render` output.
{
	"MD013": false,
	"MD024": false,
	"MD025": false
}
